Package: scripts
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34)
Maintainer: Younes BENMOUSSA <younes.benmoussa@pm.me>
Homepage: https://github.com/benmoussa-younes/scripts
Description: typed scripting language with a native interpreter
 scripts is a statically typed scripting language. Its interpreter is shipped
 in a single native binary (Native AOT, .NET 10); it needs no .NET runtime.
 .
 It provides a static checker, a frozen standard library
 (filesystem, processes, environment), typed errors
 (result<T,E>) and a machine description (scripts describe --format json).
 .
 This package installs the /usr/bin/scripts executable (amd64 architecture).
 .
